{"id":"vod_sn_36118","vodId":"36118","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"我立于百万生命之上第一季","name_cn":"我立于百万生命之上第一季","date":"2020-01-01","year":"2020","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/af906e91be38bd1d3f57948d2908deeb.jpg"},"summary":"四谷友助（上村祐翔 配音）是一名中学三年级的男生，在班上友助属于默默无闻的那类学生，他既不喜欢结交朋友，在课业上也平平无奇，总是独来独往。一天放学后，友助在意外中穿越到了异世界，让友助震惊的是，他在这里竟然遇见了同班同学新堂衣宇（久保田梨沙 配音）和箱崎红末（和气杏未 配音），她们一个是班级里人气极高的美少女，另一个则体弱多病，总是在病假中。然而，在这个世界里，他们三人是并肩作战的伙伴。　　这并不是一个和平的世界，友助一行人要对抗的，是比他们强大的多的敌人，为了获得胜利保住性命，一切都有被利用的价值，甚至是同伴们的生命，亦可拿来作为与对手博弈的棋子。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:40:31","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Xph2EHDxtX1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/eCXMSWtsHz1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/wBKyWa7qp51/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/UuAGfj8bZ71/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/C1t3sXieN11/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/jirZ5EbJ3z1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/BQfqWnmLce1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/0YM3LkmK5i1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/5i36uDkHej1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/sc2miqYEMH1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/cSqnvt8ELa1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/nDpg2pTQKV1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:26.670Z"}